            "review_title": "Review at BackYard Beer Garden",
            "review_text": "Pandy76\nHarrogate, United Kingdom45 contributions\n0\nBeautiful tranquil location and some really great tapas!\nMay 2015 • Friends\nAnother hidden gem of a restaurant just off the West Lake. We were welcomed into this beautiful beer garden by the owner, Pete, and his lovely staff. After a welcoming draft beer, we were treated to a delicious variety of Vietnamese tapas. Loved them all, but particular favorites were the yummy barbecue pork ribs, banana blossom salad and the fresh beef and mustard leaf rolls. We visited the beer garden in the evening but it would also be perfect for a long, lazy lunch! Make sure you visit this unique venue on your next trip to Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 13, 2015",
